### 1. Login og gem token automatisk
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
"email": "{{admin_email}}",
"password": "{{admin_password}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.token);
%}

### 2. Gem note med Authorization-header
POST {{host}}/api/v1/notes/save
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "text": "Dark Fantasy aesthetic Lord of the Rings",
  "userId": {{admin_id}}
}


### Hent alle gemte noter fra bruger
GET {{host}}/api/v1/notes/user/{{admin_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}